         </remove>
         <description>
            <p>
                The repository provides a set of improved Pixinsight scripts from various authors as well as some newly written scripts.
            </p>
            <p>
               Updates:
               <br/>
               Updated BBStarReduction, CSTG, ColorMaskTG, DarkStructureEnhanceTG, DeconvolutionPreviewTG, EmissionLineIntegrationTG and LocalSupportMask with compact interfaces and consistent controls. Open scripts before loading images, apply repeatedly, and use separate preview or comparison actions. Includes source-preserving output options, corrected BBStarReduction mode selection, removal of deprecated calls, and improved validation and cleanup. Refreshed PiDoc documentation includes current interface screenshots and workflow guidance.
            </p>
            <p>
               Copyright (c) 2026 Dr. Thorsten Glebe. All Rights Reserved.
            </p>
         </description>
